# Claude Code agent worktree scratch state -- local settings and session
# state stay untracked, but .claude/skills/ is a real deliverable (the
# capability catalogue) and must be committed so it survives an ephemeral
# container and loads automatically in future sessions on this repo.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
